{"id":1103,"date":"2016-04-29T19:24:53","date_gmt":"2016-04-30T00:24:53","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/herbbaldwin.wordpress.com\/?p=1103"},"modified":"2016-04-29T19:24:54","modified_gmt":"2016-04-30T00:24:54","slug":"30-days-7000-miles-who-knows-how-much","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/2016\/04\/29\/30-days-7000-miles-who-knows-how-much\/","title":{"rendered":"30 days, 7000 miles, who knows how much $$$"},"content":{"rendered":"<p>We&#8217;re finally back home in Mount Gilead, OH (April 29, 2016) after driving the motor home 5932 miles, the car (toad) another 981 miles, and I haven&#8217;t added up all the financial &#8220;damage&#8221; yet, but will post on that a little later on once I&#8217;ve deciphered my spreadsheet that I&#8217;ve kept along the way.<\/p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_1113\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-1113\" style=\"width: 355px\" class=\"wp-caption alignright\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone  wp-image-1113\" src=\"\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/04\/2016-04-29-20-14-22.jpg\" alt=\"2016-04-29 20.14.22\" width=\"355\" height=\"200\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/04\/2016-04-29-20-14-22.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/04\/2016-04-29-20-14-22-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/04\/2016-04-29-20-14-22-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/04\/2016-04-29-20-14-22-1024x576.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 355px) 100vw, 355px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-1113\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">The MoHo back at Indian Mound Lodge<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p>It was good to be with our friends tonight for our usual &#8220;Friday Night Gang&#8221; dinner out and when we got in today about 3:30 our daughter Sara was busy cleaning house in anticipation of our arrival TOMORROW, not TODAY (Surprise!)<\/p>\n<p>As I&#8217;ve said in other posts, we&#8217;ve seen lots of great scenery, met a lot of great new friends, and had the pleasure in Encinitas, CA and Surprise, AZ renewing friendships sharing stories &amp; sight-seeing.<\/p>\n<p>It was the trip of a lifetime and we&#8217;re already planning the next trip out &#8212; more to come!<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>We&#8217;re finally back home in Mount Gilead, OH (April 29, 2016) after driving the motor home 5932 miles, the car (toad) another 981 miles, and I haven&#8217;t added up all the financial &#8220;damage&#8221; yet, but will post on that a little later on once I&#8217;ve deciphered my spreadsheet that I&#8217;ve kept along the way. It &hellip; <a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/2016\/04\/29\/30-days-7000-miles-who-knows-how-much\/\" class=\"more-link\">Continue reading <span class=\"screen-reader-text\">30 days, 7000 miles, who knows how much $$$<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[91,19546],"tags":[400],"class_list":["post-1103","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","hentry","category-blogging","category-sightseeing","tag-home"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/1103","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=1103"}],"version-history":[{"count":16,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/1103\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":1120,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/1103\/revisions\/1120"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"http